dist
node_modules
*.log

# reports/ holds two DIFFERENT kinds of file, and they must not share a rule.
#
# Regenerable build output (build-report.json, release-a-evidence.json,
# MANIFEST.sha256) is rebuilt from tracked source by `npm run build` and the
# evidence probes, so it stays ignored.
#
# The two Arabic files below are NOT build output: they are the decision
# record behind docs/public/reports/RELEASE_A_ARABIC_OWNER_SIGNOFF.csv -- 42
# applied corrections, 2 rejections with their reasons, 18 legal deferrals and
# the reviewer's own 189-row decision tally. `scripts/arabic-owner-signoff.mjs`
# hard-depends on the ledger, so while these were ignored a clean checkout
# could not regenerate or even verify the sheet the owner signs OD-12 against
# (confirmed by running the generator against `git archive HEAD`: ENOENT).
# Ignoring an audit trail put it one `git clean -x` from being unrecoverable.
reports/*
!reports/arabic-corrections-ledger.json
!reports/arabic-review-intake.json
